<title>USA: Crane Co sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Crane Co sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crane Co said on Monday it plans a three-for-two stock split of its common stock to shareholders of record at the close of business on December 4.</p>
<p>The split will be come in the form of a stock dividend of one share of common stock for every two shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>It is to be paid out on December 12.</p>
<p>Crane manufactures engineered industrial products and distributes doors, windows and millwork.</p>
